REASON
New public clearCache() and the internal syncCacheVersion(). sessionStorage survives reloads, so before this a deployed release never reached a user whose tab stayed open; the app had no supported way to invalidate the cache short of sessionStorage.clear(), which also drops userProperties (auth). Keys are reset to {} rather than removed because the read paths call getIterable(), and JSON.parse(undefined) throws.

