REASON
loadPageSections uncached branch: it fetched the section config object (URL "[object Object]") instead of its .source, assigned the undeclared 'content' (a ReferenceError in a module), and never mounted what it fetched. Now fetches .source, declares the variable and mounts like the cached branch before saving.

